# layla_gifts.dialogue — Layla receiving a vending-machine snack from Fiona.
# reached from the use/give fallback titles ~ layla_item_<item_id> in
# unusables.dialogue and giveables.dialogue (which import this file).

~ liked
Layla: Oh! That's for me?
Layla: Thank you, Fiona!
Player: Sure.
Player: (Something tells me that while she liked it, she probably didn't LOVE it.)
Player: (Did I... want her to love it?)
do Flags.set_level_flag("layla_gift_given", true)
=> END

~ loved
Layla: Oh my god! That's my favorite!!
Layla: Thank you, Fee!
Player: Sure thing.
Player: (She called me Fee...)
do Flags.set_level_flag("layla_gift_given", true)
do Flags.set_level_flag("layla_gift_loved", true)
=> END
